   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Chat Receipts Flow\n\nA scripted messaging conversation with delivery details: timestamps and read ticks or a delivered receipt, a typing status in the header, a send button that morphs from mic to send, typing dots and reactions that pop onto bubbles.\n\nCategory: ui. Length: 12 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A scene needs a messaging conversation with delivery details (timestamps, ticks, a delivered receipt) without naming a chat app.\n- The whole beat should be scripted from a messages list: outgoing text types into the composer, dots precede replies, reactions pop in.\n- A customer-chat or notification story wants the header to flip between online and typing.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You only need the bare conversation without receipts: use chat-flow.\n- You only need one message landing on a beat you time yourself: use message-bubble.\n- The video must read as a specific chat app with its own chrome.\n\nVariables:\n- messages (string): Messages, default \"[{\\\"from\\\": \\\"me\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Hey \\u2014 ready for the demo?\\\", \\\"time\\\": \\\"9:40\\\"}, {\\\"from\\\": \\\"them\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yep, pushing it live now\\\", \\\"reaction\\\": \\\"\\ud83d\\udd25\\\", \\\"time\\\": \\\"9:41\\\"}, {\\\"from\\\": \\\"me\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Perfect, sending the link over\\\", \\\"reaction\\\": \\\"\\ud83d\\udc4d\\\", \\\"time\\\": \\\"9:41\\\"}]\"\n- contact_name (string): Contact name, default \"Sam\"\n- style (enum): Style, default \"ticks\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#7c5cff\"\n- theme (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
